    "body": "Local commit fea0e2671 on issue/2483-main-red-fix. The quick gate runs now.\n\n- `microarc_test_part::a_wrapped_op_on_the_test_part_posts_wrapped_a`: one turning arc posts 8 chords, not 7. Commit 8f99bcb4c changed `arc_chords` in `crates/cl/src/cl/moves.rs`: when the two radii differ, the step also obeys a curvature bound. #2386 made the golden on an older base. Only that hunk of the golden changes.\n- `stock_source_holes::framed_stock_chamfer_live_refusal_keeps_hint_without_local_move_number`: the fixture rides at mid-wall (Z10). At the stock top a 10-degree plane cuts a line on the top face, and the #2450 wall law refuses it correctly. The asserts do not change.\n- `guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`: passes on 2c789ed6d. No change.\n\nThe two named tests pass locally. The reasons are in `docs/decisions/2483-main-red-fixtures.md`.",
